{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"@property"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"assign"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BOOL","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"showsScale"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The scale bar may not be shown at all zoom levels. The scale bar becomes visible"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the maximum distance visible on the map view is less than 400 miles (800"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"kilometers). The zoom level where this occurs depends on the latitude at the map"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"view’s center coordinate, as well as the device screen width. At latitudes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"farther from the equator, the scale bar becomes visible at lower zoom levels."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The unit of measurement is determined by the user’s device locale."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The view controlled by this property is available at "},{"code":"scaleBar","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The default value"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of this property is "},{"code":"NO","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplib